# Local development framework.
# Two things are tracked here: the STATE RECORD (state.json plus its four
# rendered views, Loop 4 C4) and the INSTRUCTION SURFACE — every file that
# tells an agent what to do in a session (Loop 11, session 62).
#
# Until 2026-09-17 the instruction surface was ignored entirely: 39 of 77
# instruction files were absent from history, CLAUDE.md among them, so a
# fresh clone got no instructions at all and a repair to a live command
# appeared in no diff and could not be restored. Only project-template/ —
# the copy shipped to other projects — was versioned.
#
# Still local by intent: session logs, archive/, working task specs,
# .claude/settings.local.json, and third-party plugin skills.
/.agents/*
!/.agents/state.json
!/.agents/AGENT.md
!/.agents/LIFECYCLE.md
!/.agents/retirements.json
!/.agents/TASKS/
/.agents/TASKS/*
!/.agents/TASKS/INBOX.md
!/.agents/TASKS/task.md
!/.agents/SESSIONS/
/.agents/SESSIONS/*
!/.agents/SESSIONS/next-session.md
!/.agents/SYSTEM/
/.agents/SYSTEM/*
!/.agents/SYSTEM/SUMMARY.md
!/.agents/SYSTEM/RULES.md
!/.agents/SYSTEM/RUNBOOK.md
!/.agents/SYSTEM/SECURITY.md
!/.agents/SYSTEM/TESTING.md
!/.agents/SYSTEM/domains.json
!/.agents/skills/
/.agents/skills/*
!/.agents/skills/INDEX.md
!/.agents/skills/self-improving-agent-gotchas/
!/.agents/skills/self-improving-agent-guide/
# .claude/: the live commands are tracked; local settings and plugin skills are not.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/commands/
# docs/: working material stays local, but LOOP CLOSE-OUTS ARE THE RECORD and are tracked.
# Loop 10's six docs were tracked only because someone remembered `git add -f`; Loop 11's
# close-out was silently dropped from its own commit because nobody did. A rule that must be
# remembered is not a rule (Loop 10 R4), so the negation replaces the habit.
# The parent must be `/docs/*` rather than `/docs/` — git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent DIRECTORY is excluded.
/docs/*
!/docs/loops/

# Runtime artifacts (session-local / regenerated)
/.recalled-entries.json
/open-brain/.agents/
AGENTS.md

# WIP — not ready for public repo yet
/a2a-wrapper/
.gitnexus

# Build artifacts
open-brain/build/
